.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK SPRINT TRANSITION"
.SH NAME
hamstik sprint transition \- Transition a sprint to a target state
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik sprint transition [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Transition a sprint to a target state
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I ID
Sprint id (UUID)
.TP
.I TARGET
Target state
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --move-to-backlog
Move unfinished work items back to the backlog when completing
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --move-to-sprint
Move unfinished work items to this future sprint
.TP
.B --force
Bypass revision conflict protection (If-Match: *)
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --project
Project key (overrides context)
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
